  "concept": {
    "zh": "次数编码 · 字典解码 · 三张地图",
    "en": "Run lengths · Codebook lookup · Three maps"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "扫描里有路线电报 packets 和本次的方向字典 directions。每个电报包是［代号，重复次数］。按包的顺序执行，从字典读取每个实际方向，再拾取出口处的零件。同一程序要处理三张地图，代号和次数都会换。",
    "en": "The scan holds a telegram named packets and the current directions codebook. Each packet is [code, repeat count]. Follow the packets in order, looking up each direction in the codebook, then pick up the part at the exit. One program must handle all three maps, with different codes and counts."
  },
